      "note": [
        "When .. presents, this indicates that the value is zero or confidential.",
        "In connection with the publishing of the second quarter 2024, the statistics was revised for the time periods 2021Q2 to 2024Q1. Total inventories now also cover industries (NACE J58-63) information and communication and (NACE M69-75) professional, scientific and technical services, which means that the definition of the total differs from before.",
        "In connection with the publishing of the third quarter 2024, the statistics was revised for the time periods 2023Q2 to 2024Q2. ",
        "In connection with the publishing of the fourth quarter 2024, the statistics was revised for the time periods 2021Q2 to 2024Q3."
